---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Project terms | Plumba"
  description="Project availability, source code, and information about the Plumba website."
>
  <section class="mx-auto w-[calc(100%-40px)] max-w-[760px] pt-10 pb-16 min-[601px]:w-[calc(100%-64px)] min-[601px]:pt-16">
    <header class="mb-10 border-b border-border pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight min-[601px]:text-4xl">
        Project terms
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-muted-foreground">
        What to know while Plumba takes shape.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="space-y-9 [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:leading-7 [&_p]:mt-3 [&_p]:max-w-[65ch] [&_p]:leading-7 [&_p]:text-muted-foreground">
      <div>
        <h2>Project status</h2>
        <p>
          Plumba is in active development. This website explains the direction
          of the project and the workflow being built. It does not announce a
          release date or confirm that every described capability is available
          today.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>Using the software</h2>
        <p>
          Check the{' '}
          <a
            class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring"
            href="https://github.com/theobiabo/plumba"
          >
            Plumba repository
          </a>
          for the source code, current development status, and any applicable
          license terms before using the software. This page does not replace
          the terms that apply to the code.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>This website</h2>
        <p>
          Browsing this website does not create an account, enroll a machine, or
          deploy a blockchain node. There are no purchases or financial
          transactions on this website.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>External resources</h2>
        <p>
          Links to other websites provide additional project information. Those
          websites maintain their own content and terms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        class="inline-block text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary focus-visible:rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring"
        href="/"
      >
        Back to Plumba
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
